From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b.c>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:18:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] feat(web): single-column model picker with providers on top

The docked composer picker stacked three columns: a vertical provider rail, the model list and a
reasoning column. It is now one column: the providers in a row, then search, the model list, the
reasoning levels as one segmented control with the model's other options below, and the footer.
The settings pickers share the provider row. A model without levels or options has no section.
